      "text": "Spiderman risks the entire world to get his friends into MIT—I’d be lying if I said I was that risk-seeking in high school!\n\nI’m excited to see a new generation inspired by @TomHolland1996 &amp; @Zendaya to be engineers, rather than rest on the laurels of legacy (cough Harvard 😉).",
